::Using git::
What is the git command for uploading files into a remote repository?
{
=git push
~git place
~git create
~git new
}

::Using git::
What is the git command for downloading files from a remote repository?
{
~git get
=git pull
~git retrieve
~git pop
}

::Using git::
What is the git command for integrating changes?
{
=git merge
~git combine
~git blend
~git mix
}
